# This file contains descriptions of VMWARE_GUESTS USE_EXPAND flags.

# Keep it sorted.

darwin - VMWARE_GUESTS setting to install VMware Tools for macOS guests
linux - VMWARE_GUESTS setting to install VMware Tools for Linux guests
linuxpreglibc25 - VMWARE_GUESTS setting to install VMware Tools for Linux guests with glibc older than 2.5
netware - VMWARE_GUESTS setting to install VMware Tools for NetWare guests
solaris - VMWARE_GUESTS setting to install VMware Tools for Solaris guests
windows - VMWARE_GUESTS setting to install VMware Tools for Windows guests
winpre2k - VMWARE_GUESTS setting to install VMware Tools for pre-Windows-2000 guests
winprevista - VMWARE_GUESTS setting to install VMware Tools for pre-Windows-Vista guests
